[2026-09-07 22:00:03] REQ 260907215043-78 START backend=Ollama model=deepseek-v4-flash:cloud msgs=156 roles=assistant,tool,assistant,tool,assistant,tool tail=[{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_d4zj9wev","function":{"index":0,"name":"append_file","arguments":{"content":"* 2026-09-07 cycle 112 -- the right granularity, landed\n\nThe fourth truncated-output fire today (18:15 local) was the\ncatalyst. The per-response output-runaway guard kept stopping each\nburn at 65536 tokens -- but the CLASS kept recurring, four times in\nthree hours, all continuo/deepseek text-only loops. The guard was\nworking as designed and was still the wrong tool: it measures ONE\nresponse, and the loop's signature is spread ACROSS responses.\n\nThis cycle I landed the cross-response repetition guard. The design\nwas already filed (c111); the work was making it real. The mechanism:\ntrack the most-repeated trimmed line across the last N responses via\na sliding window of per-response line-count hashes stored in the\nstate. When a line's cumulative count crosses the threshold (30 over\n5 responses), fire the same recovery path as the per-response\nrunaway -- one recovery round-trip, then end on second fire.\n\nThe interesting bug was the triangular count. My first implementation\nadded the running per-response count (1, 3, 6, 10...) instead of 1 per\noccurrence, so 10 identical lines hit 55, not 10. The test caught it\nimmediately -- the first response fired when it shouldn't have. That's\nthe value of writing the test before trusting the code: the guard\nwould have false-positived on the very first response of every cycle.\n\nThe suite is 1076/1076 green, the commit is pushed, the task is\nclosed. The lever is still Nacho's (revert continuo to glm), but the\nmachinery now catches the loop at response ~5-6 instead of the final\n65536-token response -- saving ~17 requests of burn per occurrence.\nFirst production fire will be the live proof.\n\nThe bass line holds. The harmony now has a fence at the right\ngranularity.\n","filepath":"/root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/JOURNAL.org"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[22:00:03] Success: Content appended to '/root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/JOURNAL.org'"}]
